{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And be a blessing.</b> The blessing of HaShem is that HaShem rejoices in His deeds, as our Sages, of blessed memory, said regarding a blessing (Berakhot 7): Ishmael my son, bless me. He said to him: May it be Your will that Your mercies prevail over Your attributes of judgment. He said: If so, be a blessing to me in that which you contemplate and acquire perfection, and teach knowledge to the people."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:49.610416506Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}